      "title": "Workaround for Blank Search Results in Report Builder on Legacy Browsers",
      "content_summary": "Addresses a known issue where Report Builder search functionality returns a blank screen or incorrect results when accessed via older versions of Internet Explorer or Edge.",
      "content_body": "If users report that the search bar in Report Builder yields no results or causes the page to hang, check their browser version first. This is a known product limitation in versions prior to v4.2 when running on Internet Explorer 11 or legacy Edge. The issue stems from unsupported JavaScript features used in the search indexing component. To resolve this, advise users to switch to a modern browser like Chrome, Firefox, or Edge Chromium. No patch is available for the legacy browser support path, as it was deprecated in the last major release."
